    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d612">

                <pb facs="0588" n="576" xml:id="pg576"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">891.515/98: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Iran</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Dreyfus</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tehran</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-04-27T11:00:00+03:25">April 27, 1943—11
                            a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received April 27—9:53 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>433. Substance of Department’s 189, April 19, 5 p.m., was communicated to
                    Millspaugh. Banque Mellie applied to Federal Reserve Bank of New York through
                    Irving Trust Company for permit to export $500,000 worth of gold which has just
                    been approved.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dreyfus</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
